OL,3,GNEWSAPrivate school for sale a year
OL,4,Aafter closure
OL,5,
OL,6,FA private school which closed last year
OL,7,Fhas gone up for sale for an undisclosed
OL,8,Fprice.
OL,10,FMoorlands School on Fox Hill Drive,
OL,11,FLeeds, which educated children aged two
OL,12,Fto 11, shut in December, citing VAT on
OL,13,Ffees and rising budgets as contributing
OL,14,Ffactors.
OL,16,FThe building was originally the home of
OL,17,Fthe Tetley brewing family before
OL,18,FMoorlands moved in in the 1960s.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
