OL,3,GNEWSAPrivate school for sale a year
OL,4,Aafter closure
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn advert on property website Rightmove
OL,7,Fstates the 3.62-acre (1.47-hectare)
OL,8,Fsite, which comprises a Victorian
OL,9,Fhouse, sports hall and swimming pool,
OL,10,Foffered "significant potential for
OL,11,Fresidential-led redevelopment".
